hics↑ + GL mtrack↑ 两项占比高</p>","uid":"5b49956a-877c-45cf-8faf-5d6306fa6e5b","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>全局dumpsys meminfo&nbsp;&nbsp;泄漏应用排名靠前， GL mtrack ↑+ 1,414,636K private↑ </p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"2a2b22f5-6c6f-44b5-9c7e-fcccb10544c3"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>显示GPU驱动内存泄漏</p>","uid":"43848668-64e3-4c20-a5f0-1143a62d4e9e","richText":true,"expand":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>特征</p>","uid":"e8fc980c-63d7-4dd7-b5fa-7eecf39751dd","richText":true,"expand":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>全局 dumpsys meinfo中 没有应用内存高占用情况 但是&nbsp;&nbsp;GPU: XXXXK高 ( 606,041K dmabuf + 4,123,123K private) 4,123,123K private↑ 项占用特别高</p>","uid":"c8a9205e-f0ba-4a72-9a88-5e28b02cce81","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>排查手段</p>","uid":"d944d02f-13bd-4ab9-8f6c-a354c99092ab","richText":true,"expand":true,"isActive":false},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>可能需要厂商协助获取 对应节点 例如 dmabuf_dump /gpu_memory信息等</p>","uid":"fb44a9da-b78b-4f7d-8910-27812e30afdf","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"data":{"text":"<p>排除手段</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"ef90d0cc-579e-45a4-ba7e-b600d7a8d276"},"children":[{"data":{"text":"<p>dumpsys meminfo 包名</p>","uid":"210e5da9-1621-4973-a1a7-ebf0fdb0f0f8","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>dumpsys meminfo</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"13d2de28-c477-4871-899f-8bb3af9cf7e6"},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>dumpsys gfxinfo</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"8faaaad8-4bf3-43d6-8ea5-2dbe322f5a42"},"children":[]},{"data":{"text":"<p>等其他dump手段</p>","expand":true,"richText":true,"isActive":false,"uid":"8f0d3b11-9184-43a1-9abc-00f5913e7879"},"children":[]}]}]}]}],"smmVersion":"0.14.0-fix.3"},"theme":{"template":"classic4","co